---
import Container from "@layouts/Container.astro";
import HorizontalBar from "@components/shared/HorizontalBar.astro";
---

<section class="py-12">
  <Container>
    <h2>About Sulery Computer Technologies</h2>
    <HorizontalBar />

    <div class="mt-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 w-full">
      <div class="grid gap-4">
        <p>
          We have the pleasure of introducing to you our company Sulery Computer
          Technologies, a subsidiary of Sulery Ventures, situated in Apapa,
          Surulere, and Ikorodu, Nigeria.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are a reputable company dealing in the sales, supply, repair and
          maintenance of computer equipment, office equipment, accessories,
          peripherals, consumables, systems networking, internet connectivity,
          general printing, cybercafe installation, WAEC and NECO CBT deployment
          and CCTV installations, intercoms and access control implementation
          and website design.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are committed to tested brand names in the computer industry such
          as IBM, HP, Acer, Epson, APC, Dell, Lenovo etc. in the delivery of our
          services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4">
        <p>
          Not only are our equipment of the highest standard and quality, we
          also run a very well equipped maintenance unit that carries out a
          regular check on all computer equipment supplied by us. We can also go
          into maintenance contract with your organization for your existing
          computer equipment and machines.
        </p>

        <p>
          We run a well equipped engineering department for repairs and after
          sales maintenance, and also handle both Local Area Network (LAN) and
          Wide Area Network (WAN) networking through cable or wireless
          connections.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h3>The various items we offer include:</h3>

      <ol class="mt-4 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Computer hardware and peripherals:</strong> Multimedia
          systems, workstations and servers for networking environments,
          printers (LaserJet, DeskJet, OfficeJet, Photosmart, and Dot Matrix),
          UPS, scanners, plotters, routers and switches.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Computer software:</strong> Operating systems, word
          processing, spreadsheet, database management, multimedia, accounting,
          insurance, medical, architectural and flight booking software etc.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Computer accessories and consumables:</strong> Toner and ink
          cartridges, blank CD and DVD, memory cards, flash drives, Bluetooth,
          external backup discs, wireless adapters, etc.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Office equipment:</strong> A whole range of branded desktop,
          laptop and mini computers, iPad, fax machines, internet devices,
          photocopy machines and filing cabinets.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Office furniture:</strong> A whole range of office furniture
          according to client's specifications.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>CCTV installation:</strong> We can handle installations of
          both real-time online analog and IP camera surveillance devices in
          offices and residential spaces, with remote view from any part of the
          world.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-6" />

    <p>
      Have a project in mind? <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-3 py-2 bg-black text-white border border-black hover:bg-light-accent hover:text-black transition-all duration-300"
        >Contact us</a
      >
    </p>
  </Container>
</section>
